From db08b4371c46ea966f3994c070438007e1869b54 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 14:55:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): never subscribe, inherit, link or notify a
 Kanban worker transcript [daveey]

Hub card t_a989e5e0 held five MacBook worker-transcript shepherd subs (copied on link
from t_ae24b36d via _inherit_notify_subs); on done the unloaded/remote sweep wrote its
notice into each transcript and every wake was refused (session.resume 4132).

- add_notify_sub refuses hub/tui subs on a local-<sha256> receipt session
- _owning_sub_clause never inherits a worker-transcript sub (rows written earlier)
- chat-link reconcile never writes and retires shepherd links on worker sessions
- remote sweep (_deliver_link) settles worker targets with swept reason
  worker_transcript: no row, no wake; the unloaded sweep drops such a sub
  (receipt id or SessionDB.is_kanban_owned_session)
